  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connecting Pacific people with Pacific cultural heritage and histories digitally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to help connect Pacific people with Pacific cultural heritage items and histories held in museums and galleries all over the world, through an online portal.  Including significant co-design, collaboration and outreach with Pacific cultural institutions and communities, this online portal will enable Pacific people to create and share their stories through easy digital access to Pacific cultural heritage.  It will also contribute to safeguarding cultural heritage and advancing cultural innovation as well as providing education and research resource on Pacific material heritage.</narrative>
  </description>
